{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/985193-voice-note-taking-apps","id":985193,"title":"Voice Note-taking Apps","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Off-Topic"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-10-10T18:39:58-07:00","id":985193,"title":"Voice Note-taking Apps","content":"So I often have ideas for games, or how I can solve a problem or whatever, when I'm working on something else. And I could write it down, but usually that takes too long and I lose half the thought. So I've been playing around with using a voice recorder app on my phone, to good effect. My current phone is an Android, if it helps.<br /> <br /> Unfortunately, that records every &quot;session&quot; as its own file. Which is fine, but gets a bit unmanagable at times. Does anyone know any apps that allow &quot;adding in&quot; later recordings to pre-existing tracks? I've got a digital recorder that lets me do that, but I'm trying to minimise the number of things I carry, which means maximising the usefulness of each individual thing.<br /> <br /> Thanks in advance!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1mSW2-p-SwmYw5gaqnVMQ7HcRNhVedC-aA4vB6sBclGk/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My Commandments for GMs</a> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1hslzrmui6ML-v7LniQUXLNyy8o52YF9g2u6usdu-Drc/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My Commandments for Players</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/207-allan53","name":"Allan53","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"966"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-10T23:41:32-07:00","id":985295,"title":"","content":"I use <a href=\"https://evernote.com/\" target=\"_blank\">https://evernote.com/</a> but I haven't tried it's voice feature, so I'm not sure if it can append audio to existing. I just know that it's free and you can sync via their cloud server and access all notes from any device.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2456-zeroninja","name":"zeroninja","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2456_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"87"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-11T03:57:08-07:00","id":985345,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>zeroninja</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/985193-voice-note-taking-apps?p=985295#post985295\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I use <a href=\"https://evernote.com/\" target=\"_blank\">https://evernote.com/</a> but I haven't tried it's voice feature, so I'm not sure if it can append audio to existing. I just know that it's free and you can sync via their cloud server and access all notes from any device.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, I used to use Evernote, but then they started getting ornery about number of devices, so I'm moving away from them (although I still use them a little bit).<br /> <br /> Anyway, I'm less interested in a repository for my ideas, and more a program which'd work well as a recording of them in a convenient location - ideally with the option of putting them all on one track.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1mSW2-p-SwmYw5gaqnVMQ7HcRNhVedC-aA4vB6sBclGk/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My Commandments for GMs</a> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1hslzrmui6ML-v7LniQUXLNyy8o52YF9g2u6usdu-Drc/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My Commandments for Players</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/207-allan53","name":"Allan53","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"966"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}